rs/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T10:48:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T10:48:08Z","body":"There's also an issue where the `label`'s `for` must match the `input`'s `id` instead of the `id` of the root element, in which case it should be labelled with `aria-labelledby=\"(label id)\"`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"800\" height=\"126\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-14 at 6 45 42 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ece35a5-206a-4e28-8d13-d7b0c5f5ae6d\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3532146046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3532171137","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3532171137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3532171137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7SiKeB","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T10:53:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T10:53:02Z","body":"@mj12albert yeah, `Select` forwards the `id` to the hidden input. Clicking the label focuses the hidden input, so `onFocus` is used to immediately relocate it to the trigger. I think that's the correct solution when using non-`<button>` triggers (although Select was recently changed to be a native `<button>`)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3532171137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3534293844","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3534293844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3534293844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7SqQtU","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T19:39:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T19:39:47Z","body":"> `Select` forwards the `id` to the hidden input.\r\n\r\nOK doign the same here but a gotcha with this is that `<Select.Trigger id=\"MyTrigger\" />` id's the input and not the actual trigger, though I suppose manual ids are an edge case in 2025...","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3534293844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3539863927","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3539863927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3539863927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7S_gl3","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T04:04:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T04:04:59Z","body":"> Clicking a plain sibling <label> (even with for/id set correctly) is unable to toggle span role=\"checkbox\"\r\n\r\nIt seems to work with a minimal repro:\r\n\r\n```jsx\r\nexport default function Checkbox() {\r\n  const ref = React.useRef<HTMLSpanElement>(null);\r\n  const [checked, setChecked] = React.useState(false);\r\n  return (\r\n    <div>\r\n      <label htmlFor=\"checkbox\">Checkbox</label>\r\n      <span\r\n        ref={ref}\r\n        role=\"checkbox\"\r\n        aria-checked={checked}\r\n        style={{\r\n          display: 'inline-block',\r\n          width: 20,\r\n          height: 20,\r\n          background: checked ? 'blue' : 'gray',\r\n        }}\r\n        onClick={() => setChecked(!checked)}\r\n        tabIndex={0}\r\n      />\r\n      <input\r\n        id=\"checkbox\"\r\n        onFocus={() => {\r\n          ref.current?.focus();\r\n        }}\r\n        onClick={() => {\r\n          ref.current?.click();\r\n        }}\r\n        tabIndex={-1}\r\n        aria-hidden\r\n      />\r\n    </div>\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3539863927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540123743","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3540123743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3540123743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7TAgBf","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T06:05:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T06:05:02Z","body":"> > Clicking a plain sibling  (even with for/id set correctly) is unable to toggle span role=\"checkbox\"\r\n> \r\n> It seems to work with a minimal repro:\r\n\r\nOh yeah it works, I didn't update this comment yet 😅 \r\nOriginally I thought it wasn't working because there is a weird behavior where an identical test for Switch fails for Checkbox because it's flaky when using `user.click`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540123743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540283974","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3540283974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3540283974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7TBHJG","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T07:11:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T07:11:25Z","body":"Features all seem intact, the only issue now is `<label><span role=\"checkbox\" /></label>` like in the demos messes up the accName:\r\n<img width=\"800\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 2 59 15 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8ca3d8d-515c-43fd-94a2-4eb923667187\" />\r\n\r\nManually setting `htmlFor`/`id` doesn't help because the `id` is forwarded to the `input`, so it doesn't link the span, only `aria-label` on the span works... what do you think? @atomiks \r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540283974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540347376","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3540347376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3540347376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7TBWnw","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T07:34:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T07:34:19Z","body":"> in the demos messes up the accName:\r\n\r\nIs this more so an axe false positive? Without `aria-label`, the enclosing label announces its text when focus is on the `<span>` checkbox. If so, I think it's okay since there are workarounds to satisfy it if necessary","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540347376/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540357768","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3540357768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3540357768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7TBZKI","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T07:38:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T07:38:19Z","body":"Alright, with VO the differences seem negligible anyway","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3540357768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3543275783","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205#issuecomment-3543275783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","id":3543275783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7TMhkH","user":{"login":"hsimpson270","id":34924402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTI0NDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34924402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270","html_url":"https://github.com/hsimpson270","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsimpson270/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T18:17:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T18:17:24Z","body":"I have updated my project to use beta 5, but I am seeing a conflict because of this change. `CheckboxRootProps` was updated to extend `BaseUIComponentProps<'span', CheckboxRoot.State>,` but `CheckboxRoot` was not updated as well, so it still typed as `React.ForwardRefExoticComponent<CheckboxRootProps & React.RefAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>>`. This causes an issue because `CheckboxRoot` is expected to extend a button, but its props are expected to extend a span.\r\n\r\nIn my implementation, updating my custom props to extend either a button or a span both result in errors when passed into `CheckboxRoot`. I was using button previously, which now generates a \"Types of property 'onCopy' are incompatible\" error (I'm assuming because that's the first native prop that conflicts), but if I update to use span instead I get a \"Types of property 'ref' are incompatible.\" error. This error completely breaks the current implementation, so the only work around I can think of for now would be to not extend a native HTML element in my props at all.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3543275783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]